1
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:43,020
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,110 --> 00:01:43,680
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:45,910
[Episode 27]

4
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:21,960
Father.

5
00:03:42,030 --> 00:03:42,840
Your Majesty.

6
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,960
The Fourth Prince is here.

7
00:03:50,910 --> 00:03:51,770
Fourth Prince,

8
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:54,220
pay your respects to His Majesty.

9
00:04:00,510 --> 00:04:03,330
I, Li Si, Divine Constable Qingyang,

10
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:06,360
pay my respects to Your Majesty.

11
00:04:10,590 --> 00:04:11,400
Yan?

12
00:04:15,170 --> 00:04:16,320
Is that Yan?

13
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:18,630
You're back?

14
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:20,570
Yes.

15
00:04:23,250 --> 00:04:24,610
I'm back.

16
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:32,830
It's good.

17
00:04:36,950 --> 00:04:38,680
It's good that you're home now.

18
00:04:45,870 --> 00:04:47,670
I remember when you were little,

19
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:51,310
you always played so wildly,

20
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,270
and I always

21
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:57,360
had to look for you

22
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,760
all over Tianhuang City.

23
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:02,480
But no matter where you hid,

24
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:05,190
I could always find you.

25
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:11,640
This was the only time I ever lost you,

26
00:05:15,070 --> 00:05:18,000
and it's been 17 years since then.

27
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:20,920
Yan,

28
00:05:21,950 --> 00:05:23,120
where on earth

29
00:05:23,950 --> 00:05:25,120
have you been hiding

30
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:29,270
all these years by yourself?

31
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:32,390
Father.

32
00:05:34,430 --> 00:05:35,510
The world is vast,

33
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:38,409
and there is always a place to stay.

34
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:40,310
I've roamed jianghu

35
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,310
and done business,

36
00:05:43,490 --> 00:05:44,720
going through

37
00:05:44,830 --> 00:05:45,720
ups and downs.

38
00:05:47,100 --> 00:05:48,760
It hasn't been a waste of time.

39
00:06:22,870 --> 00:06:23,800
Get up. Hurry.

40
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:38,120
How did you

41
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:43,800
grow up so fast?

42
00:07:00,330 --> 00:07:01,090
Father,

43
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:02,920
for 17 years,

44
00:07:04,710 --> 00:07:07,240
I have never fulfilled my filial duties.

45
00:07:08,510 --> 00:07:10,120
I've come back too late

46
00:07:11,530 --> 00:07:13,130
and caused you so much worry.

47
00:07:13,880 --> 00:07:15,150
It's my fault.

48
00:07:26,310 --> 00:07:29,670
Do you know how much I missed you?

49
00:07:35,159 --> 00:07:37,860
I missed you so much!

50
00:07:41,159 --> 00:07:43,159
Yan!

51
00:07:45,330 --> 00:07:47,250
Yan!

52
00:08:19,070 --> 00:08:20,870
Who made a mess

53
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:22,540
of my Imperial Study?

54
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:23,590
Father.

55
00:08:25,190 --> 00:08:25,870
Look,

56
00:08:25,870 --> 00:08:27,910
I planted a little tree.

57
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:30,070
Let me ask you.

58
00:08:30,270 --> 00:08:31,160
One big, one small,

59
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:32,320
one tall, one short—

60
00:08:32,470 --> 00:08:34,270
how does that fit with the royal way

61
00:08:34,270 --> 00:08:36,669
of impartiality, balance, and propriety?

62
00:08:36,870 --> 00:08:38,200
I don't care about

63
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:39,530
harmony or moderation.

64
00:08:39,549 --> 00:08:41,080
I just think,

65
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,150
with one big tree

66
00:08:42,150 --> 00:08:44,510
standing all alone in this Imperial Study,

67
00:08:44,510 --> 00:08:46,440
it would be lonely.

68
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:55,910
Let me see your dirty little face.

69
00:08:57,390 --> 00:08:58,200
Come on.

70
00:09:03,100 --> 00:09:03,900
Yan.

71
00:09:11,510 --> 00:09:13,240
Let's have this little tree...

72
00:09:16,670 --> 00:09:17,480
stay with the big tree forever.

73
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:18,870
How about that?

74
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:25,010
Alright.

75
00:09:31,270 --> 00:09:32,110
Come on.

76
00:09:32,430 --> 00:09:34,030
I'll plant it with you.

77
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:11,030
At first,

78
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:13,270
I was abducted

79
00:10:13,630 --> 00:10:14,830
and couldn't return.

80
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:19,080
Later, when I grew up a bit,

81
00:10:19,910 --> 00:10:21,570
I thought that returning then

82
00:10:21,960 --> 00:10:23,620
might destabilize the court,

83
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:27,440
so I decided to uncover the truth first.

84
00:10:37,270 --> 00:10:39,670
I already know what your eldest

85
00:10:40,750 --> 00:10:42,480
and second brothers have done.

86
00:10:46,910 --> 00:10:48,270
But besides them,

87
00:10:48,510 --> 00:10:49,390
there was someone behind it

88
00:10:49,390 --> 00:10:50,720
who abducted me.

89
00:10:51,270 --> 00:10:53,400
They must have had an ulterior motive.

90
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:54,240
Therefore,

91
00:10:54,910 --> 00:10:57,080
I had to get to the bottom of it.

92
00:10:58,720 --> 00:10:59,480
The reason

93
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:01,030
I chose to return now

94
00:11:01,550 --> 00:11:02,480
is that

95
00:11:02,670 --> 00:11:04,670
the sixth mural in Tianshu Pavilion

96
00:11:04,750 --> 00:11:06,410
is on the verge of shattering.

97
00:11:07,150 --> 00:11:08,810
I was afraid Liluo's curse...

98
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:12,270
would come true.

99
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:16,320
You've been through so much.

100
00:11:16,440 --> 00:11:18,030
You're still my good child,

101
00:11:18,510 --> 00:11:20,080
just as you always were.

102
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:25,030
But I'm old now.

103
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:27,270
I can no longer bear

104
00:11:27,910 --> 00:11:29,440
the burden on my shoulders.

105
00:11:29,750 --> 00:11:31,480
I can only pass it on to you.

106
00:11:42,030 --> 00:11:42,840
Father,

107
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:44,840
rest assured.

108
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:46,080
Now

109
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:47,840
that I've returned as Zhou Yan,

110
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:49,910
I won't let those

111
00:11:49,910 --> 00:11:51,510
with malicious intentions

112
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:54,030
get what they want.

113
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:58,580
All the memories are back.

114
00:11:59,150 --> 00:11:59,960
Father,

115
00:12:00,030 --> 00:12:01,870
even if I were wronged,

116
00:12:01,470 --> 00:12:05,470
[Gentle Breeze and Auspicious Clouds]

117
00:12:01,870 --> 00:12:03,030
it wouldn't matter.

118
00:12:03,030 --> 00:12:05,240
All I want is for you not to go gray.

119
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:05,910
Alright.

120
00:12:06,270 --> 00:12:07,270
I grant your wish.

121
00:12:07,270 --> 00:12:08,320
A ruler never goes back on his word.

122
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:09,080
Pinky swear.

123
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:10,630
A ruler never goes back on his word.

124
00:12:10,630 --> 00:12:11,790
I promise you.

125
00:12:22,440 --> 00:12:25,320
Crown Prince, Zhou Tiao,
has violated moral principles

126
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:26,870
and shown himself unworthy.

127
00:12:25,400 --> 00:12:28,580
[Shi]

128
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:28,840
He is to be confined to his residence

129
00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:30,170
and forbidden to leave.

130
00:12:31,080 --> 00:12:34,270
Prince Ding, Zhou Miao,
colluded with foreign enemies

131
00:12:34,750 --> 00:12:36,390
and harmed his own kin.

132
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:38,080
Effective today,

133
00:12:38,670 --> 00:12:40,670
he is stripped of his princely title

134
00:12:40,910 --> 00:12:42,630
and demoted to a commoner.

135
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:44,900
Zhou Yan, by imperial decree,

136
00:12:44,910 --> 00:12:46,910
I hereby bestow upon you the title
of Prince Xian

137
00:12:46,910 --> 00:12:48,790
and the imperial seal.

138
00:12:49,480 --> 00:12:50,910
You are granted seven pearls,

139
00:12:50,910 --> 00:12:53,850
thereby placing you
above all other princes and nobles.

140
00:12:53,850 --> 00:12:55,540
So ordered!

141
00:13:05,140 --> 00:13:12,170
[Joint Tomb of My Late Parents,
Shen Baoquan and Guan] [Tomb of Shen Lan]

142
00:13:26,270 --> 00:13:27,080
Lan,

143
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:33,840
I have failed you.

144
00:13:36,720 --> 00:13:38,580
If I'd agreed to fly kites with you

145
00:13:40,630 --> 00:13:42,090
in the mountains that day,

146
00:13:43,270 --> 00:13:45,400
we would have gone far away and hidden,

147
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:50,250
and you wouldn't have died.

148
00:14:12,870 --> 00:14:14,880
[Tomb of Shen Lan]

149
00:14:17,510 --> 00:14:18,320
Shen Lan,

150
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:21,300
you've finally come home.

151
00:15:32,730 --> 00:15:35,750
[Joint Tomb of My Late Parents,
Shen Baoquan and Guan]

152
00:16:15,730 --> 00:16:18,760
♪ Capture my heart ♪

153
00:16:19,290 --> 00:16:22,520
♪ Unravel my longing ♪

154
00:16:23,540 --> 00:16:28,940
♪ Can we relive the mark
you once carved deep? ♪

155
00:16:29,490 --> 00:16:32,520
♪ Turns out every soul ♪

156
00:16:32,910 --> 00:16:33,720
Meng Rui.

157
00:16:33,380 --> 00:16:36,540
♪ Fears deep devotion ♪

158
00:16:35,080 --> 00:16:35,910
Your father,

159
00:16:36,750 --> 00:16:37,550
mother,

160
00:16:37,610 --> 00:16:43,550
♪ In a moment, I fell,
a lifetime left to heal ♪

161
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:39,570
and younger brother

162
00:16:40,720 --> 00:16:42,080
all died because of me.

163
00:16:43,840 --> 00:16:44,910
I'm afraid

164
00:16:43,920 --> 00:16:46,980
♪ Tossing and turning
through endless nights ♪

165
00:16:46,270 --> 00:16:47,240
I'll never be able to repay what I owe you

166
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:48,390
in this lifetime.

167
00:16:47,800 --> 00:16:50,900
♪ Breaking free from a labyrinth ♪

168
00:16:49,550 --> 00:16:51,550
The ones who killed my entire family

169
00:16:51,570 --> 00:16:57,280
♪ Will we meet again,
those I dare not face? ♪

170
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:54,630
were the Liluo people.

171
00:16:57,890 --> 00:17:00,970
♪ One thought to ferry me
across the sea of suffering ♪

172
00:17:00,630 --> 00:17:01,440
Li Si.

173
00:17:01,640 --> 00:17:04,640
♪ One thought to burn me to ash ♪

174
00:17:02,720 --> 00:17:04,920
Since you know Lan died for you,

175
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:11,980
♪ A thousand schemes can never be enough,
till all turn to dust ♪

176
00:17:06,069 --> 00:17:07,109
from now on,

177
00:17:07,550 --> 00:17:09,550
you must take good care of yourself.

178
00:17:09,829 --> 00:17:10,750
Don't keep feeling

179
00:17:10,750 --> 00:17:12,270
indebted to others.

180
00:17:12,170 --> 00:17:15,240
♪ Dare not forget ♪

181
00:17:12,510 --> 00:17:14,310
Otherwise, Lan won't be able

182
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:17,030
to rest in peace.

183
00:17:15,990 --> 00:17:19,270
♪ No regret, no blame ♪

184
00:17:20,089 --> 00:17:25,640
♪ In love, I fear neither life nor death ♪

185
00:17:26,380 --> 00:17:29,330
♪ I turn a blind eye ♪

186
00:17:29,800 --> 00:17:33,160
♪ Who was it that cast the spell? ♪

187
00:17:33,750 --> 00:17:40,500
♪ Let my heart abide ♪

188
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:39,780
So you had this half

189
00:17:40,830 --> 00:17:41,920
all along?

190
00:17:42,710 --> 00:17:46,670
♪ Forever within your shadow
by your side ♪

191
00:17:49,740 --> 00:17:54,250
♪ Forever within your shadow
by your side ♪

192
00:17:57,460 --> 00:18:03,140
[Joint Tomb of My Late Parents,
Shen Baoquan and Guan] [Tomb of Shen Lan]

193
00:18:32,550 --> 00:18:33,550
Prince Xian.

194
00:18:40,940 --> 00:18:42,020
Prince Xian.

195
00:18:43,720 --> 00:18:44,750
Are you here to mock your brother,

196
00:18:44,750 --> 00:18:46,550
who's now a commoner?

197
00:18:47,820 --> 00:18:48,890
Do you remember

198
00:18:50,560 --> 00:18:51,920
the story you used to beg me to tell you

199
00:18:51,920 --> 00:18:53,350
when we were children?

200
00:18:58,400 --> 00:18:59,800
What was the story about?

201
00:19:01,790 --> 00:19:02,880
You only ever told me one story,

202
00:19:02,880 --> 00:19:03,880
Brother.

203
00:19:04,590 --> 00:19:05,510
It was about

204
00:19:06,960 --> 00:19:10,070
how Father met your birth mother,

205
00:19:10,510 --> 00:19:11,920
Lady Hu,

206
00:19:12,680 --> 00:19:13,940
here in Mount Dahuang.

207
00:19:16,550 --> 00:19:17,480
Once upon a time,

208
00:19:17,840 --> 00:19:19,990
a nobleman and a country girl

209
00:19:20,160 --> 00:19:21,830
fell in love.

210
00:19:22,400 --> 00:19:24,130
Father loved my mother dearly,

211
00:19:24,510 --> 00:19:25,830
but their social standing

212
00:19:25,830 --> 00:19:27,110
was worlds apart.

213
00:19:27,790 --> 00:19:28,510
Back then,

214
00:19:28,510 --> 00:19:30,590
Father was still living
in his princely residence.

215
00:19:30,590 --> 00:19:32,270
He feared

216
00:19:32,350 --> 00:19:33,920
angering Grandfather,

217
00:19:34,270 --> 00:19:36,530
so he never gave my mother a proper title.

218
00:19:37,510 --> 00:19:39,440
After Father ascended the throne,

219
00:19:39,510 --> 00:19:41,710
he couldn't afford to invite criticism

220
00:19:42,070 --> 00:19:44,670
because the realm
had only just been pacified,

221
00:19:45,140 --> 00:19:47,740
so he failed
to bring Lady Hu back to the palace.

222
00:19:48,070 --> 00:19:49,550
By the time the court had stabilized

223
00:19:49,550 --> 00:19:50,310
and he was finally ready

224
00:19:50,310 --> 00:19:51,920
to bring her back,

225
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:55,650
she'd already died of illness.

226
00:20:00,880 --> 00:20:02,030
I told you,

227
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:06,000
"Fourth Brother,

228
00:20:06,790 --> 00:20:07,720
if my mother had still been alive

229
00:20:07,720 --> 00:20:08,960
back then,

230
00:20:09,720 --> 00:20:11,880
your mother might not have been

231
00:20:12,510 --> 00:20:14,570
the most favored woman in the harem."

232
00:20:17,550 --> 00:20:18,510
To be honest,

233
00:20:20,480 --> 00:20:22,280
I really believed it at the time.

234
00:20:22,550 --> 00:20:23,550
But later,

235
00:20:24,880 --> 00:20:26,750
I searched through the imperial genealogy

236
00:20:26,750 --> 00:20:27,750
and couldn't find

237
00:20:27,750 --> 00:20:29,070
Lady Hu's title.

238
00:20:30,590 --> 00:20:31,820
Only then did I realize

239
00:20:31,820 --> 00:20:33,210
that what you said

240
00:20:34,070 --> 00:20:35,420
might not be true.

241
00:20:50,200 --> 00:20:51,550
In her later years, my mother

242
00:20:51,550 --> 00:20:53,350
wandered outside the palace,

243
00:20:54,920 --> 00:20:56,750
shouting and screaming

244
00:20:57,670 --> 00:20:59,070
that she wanted to see me.

245
00:21:00,350 --> 00:21:01,480
Outside the palace?

246
00:21:01,480 --> 00:21:03,160
Have you ever looked down from atop

247
00:21:03,160 --> 00:21:04,750
the Imperial City walls

248
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:06,680
at the beggars

249
00:21:06,680 --> 00:21:07,940
on the First Ring Road?

250
00:21:08,270 --> 00:21:10,030
I gave them porridge and tea

251
00:21:10,030 --> 00:21:11,750
every day.

252
00:21:11,750 --> 00:21:12,960
They all said

253
00:21:13,270 --> 00:21:15,160
I was a benevolent prince.

254
00:21:21,200 --> 00:21:22,860
But let me tell you something.

255
00:21:23,200 --> 00:21:24,750
Every single day, I could see

256
00:21:24,750 --> 00:21:25,750
my mother

257
00:21:27,510 --> 00:21:29,510
just beyond those palace walls.

258
00:21:29,750 --> 00:21:31,160
We were only a wall apart.

259
00:21:31,920 --> 00:21:33,380
I could never go out to her,

260
00:21:33,920 --> 00:21:35,720
and she could never come in to me.

261
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:38,330
So I watched her come back
again and again,

262
00:21:38,550 --> 00:21:40,310
full of hope,

263
00:21:40,310 --> 00:21:41,590
only to leave in sorrow,

264
00:21:41,590 --> 00:21:43,160
time after time.

265
00:21:45,750 --> 00:21:47,550
She came less and less often.

266
00:21:48,350 --> 00:21:49,160
Then one day,

267
00:21:52,270 --> 00:21:54,070
she stopped coming altogether.

268
00:21:56,000 --> 00:21:58,530
Of course
I could have gone out to look for her,

269
00:21:59,160 --> 00:22:00,350
but I didn't dare.

270
00:22:00,370 --> 00:22:02,230
I was afraid of offending Father.

271
00:22:04,590 --> 00:22:05,640
Let me tell you.

272
00:22:07,000 --> 00:22:08,240
To this day,

273
00:22:09,920 --> 00:22:11,590
I still don't know

274
00:22:11,720 --> 00:22:14,110
where my mother is buried.

275
00:22:16,680 --> 00:22:18,440
I could have asked around,

276
00:22:18,960 --> 00:22:20,510
but I didn't dare!

277
00:22:21,350 --> 00:22:22,270
I was afraid

278
00:22:22,720 --> 00:22:24,980
Father would remember that I, Zhou Miao,

279
00:22:25,070 --> 00:22:25,830
was nothing more

280
00:22:25,830 --> 00:22:27,960
than the illegitimate son
of a peasant girl he,

281
00:22:27,960 --> 00:22:30,110
the great Emperor Dezong, took to bed

282
00:22:30,110 --> 00:22:31,750
while drunk.

283
00:22:33,480 --> 00:22:35,640
I knew that as an illegitimate son,

284
00:22:36,070 --> 00:22:37,350
I never stood a chance

285
00:22:37,350 --> 00:22:38,810
of sitting on that throne.

286
00:22:39,510 --> 00:22:40,720
I also knew that Father

287
00:22:40,720 --> 00:22:42,750
let me cultivate a reputation
as a virtuous prince

288
00:22:42,750 --> 00:22:43,830
and promoted me

289
00:22:44,350 --> 00:22:46,510
only to temper his second son

290
00:22:46,920 --> 00:22:47,920
and keep him in check.

291
00:22:47,920 --> 00:22:49,070
But what about me?

292
00:22:49,790 --> 00:22:51,120
What right does he have?

293
00:22:51,510 --> 00:22:52,790
Why?

294
00:22:53,680 --> 00:22:55,070
I couldn't accept this.

295
00:22:55,350 --> 00:22:56,240
I know

296
00:22:57,680 --> 00:22:59,010
you're hurting inside.

297
00:23:00,310 --> 00:23:02,510
But no matter how much you've suffered,

298
00:23:02,720 --> 00:23:04,680
the people of Mingling

299
00:23:05,400 --> 00:23:06,920
and Gutan have suffered far more.

300
00:23:06,920 --> 00:23:07,750
You're right!

301
00:23:09,270 --> 00:23:10,920
I know the people are suffering.

302
00:23:10,920 --> 00:23:12,310
I know I, Zhou Miao,

303
00:23:12,860 --> 00:23:14,450
have wronged many people!

304
00:23:19,830 --> 00:23:20,760
Fourth Brother,

305
00:23:22,790 --> 00:23:24,790
the person I've wronged the most...

306
00:23:27,160 --> 00:23:28,190
is you.

307
00:23:33,500 --> 00:23:34,750
You know what?

308
00:23:35,920 --> 00:23:38,590
The one who arranged
the assassination attempt on you back then...

309
00:23:38,590 --> 00:23:39,720
was Second Brother.

310
00:23:40,160 --> 00:23:40,920
But I was the one

311
00:23:40,920 --> 00:23:43,070
who lured Father away

312
00:23:43,830 --> 00:23:44,640
that day.

313
00:23:46,490 --> 00:23:48,080
Second Brother and I

314
00:23:49,310 --> 00:23:50,920
did it together.

315
00:23:56,810 --> 00:23:58,810
Since you've admitted it yourself,

316
00:23:59,860 --> 00:24:01,790
there's nothing more for me to say.

317
00:24:15,340 --> 00:24:16,670
The years are peaceful.

318
00:24:17,460 --> 00:24:19,350
Take care of yourself.

319
00:24:19,680 --> 00:24:20,840
I don't believe it!

320
00:24:22,070 --> 00:24:23,030
I don't believe your heart

321
00:24:23,030 --> 00:24:24,070
is that pure!

322
00:24:24,110 --> 00:24:26,400
You could've returned at any time,

323
00:24:26,400 --> 00:24:27,960
but you chose to come back

324
00:24:27,960 --> 00:24:29,350
when Father was gravely ill!

325
00:24:29,350 --> 00:24:31,350
You have no ambition for the throne?

326
00:24:32,270 --> 00:24:33,240
Impossible!

327
00:24:33,550 --> 00:24:35,400
Everyone wants to be the emperor!

328
00:24:35,400 --> 00:24:36,350
Why?

329
00:24:36,350 --> 00:24:37,310
Why?

330
00:24:37,510 --> 00:24:38,400
Why?

331
00:24:39,350 --> 00:24:40,830
If you hadn't returned,

332
00:24:40,960 --> 00:24:43,350
Father might still have paid
some attention to me!

333
00:24:43,350 --> 00:24:45,220
Why did you have to come back?

334
00:24:45,350 --> 00:24:46,400
Why?

335
00:24:46,420 --> 00:24:47,960
I can't accept this!

336
00:24:48,160 --> 00:24:49,220
Why?

337
00:25:04,400 --> 00:25:06,350
Why did you come back?

338
00:25:57,310 --> 00:25:58,170
Your Highness!

339
00:26:00,310 --> 00:26:01,230
Your Highness!

340
00:26:12,960 --> 00:26:15,490
Seventeen years ago, you found me.

341
00:26:17,790 --> 00:26:19,810
Today, it's my turn to find you.

342
00:26:34,240 --> 00:26:38,060
[Yu'an Hall]

343
00:26:39,350 --> 00:26:40,880
He fell off a cliff and died?

344
00:26:52,810 --> 00:26:55,390
I can't believe it.

345
00:27:01,550 --> 00:27:02,950
Give him a proper burial.

346
00:27:04,270 --> 00:27:05,070
Bury him...

347
00:27:07,310 --> 00:27:09,370
Bury him with the honors due a prince.

348
00:27:11,080 --> 00:27:12,980
Yes, Your Majesty.

349
00:27:14,720 --> 00:27:16,200
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

350
00:27:16,760 --> 00:27:18,970
I failed you.

351
00:27:19,720 --> 00:27:22,000
We searched for half the day

352
00:27:22,550 --> 00:27:23,750
and found only

353
00:27:23,750 --> 00:27:26,170
the First Princess Consort's body,

354
00:27:27,110 --> 00:27:29,480
but we couldn't find...

355
00:27:30,350 --> 00:27:32,710
the First Prince.

356
00:27:33,130 --> 00:27:34,050
What?

357
00:27:35,350 --> 00:27:37,270
According to Chief Xuanyuan,

358
00:27:37,880 --> 00:27:40,340
not even the First Prince's
clothes or shoes

359
00:27:40,350 --> 00:27:43,920
were found

360
00:27:45,920 --> 00:27:48,790
at the bottom of the cliff.

361
00:27:58,000 --> 00:27:58,800
Your Majesty!

362
00:28:00,350 --> 00:28:01,200
Your Majesty!

363
00:28:02,480 --> 00:28:04,340
Summon the imperial physicians!

364
00:28:04,440 --> 00:28:05,240
Hurry!

365
00:28:05,720 --> 00:28:06,790
Your Majesty!

366
00:28:07,000 --> 00:28:10,320
[In the winter of the 37th year of the Hongyun Reign of Great Shi,]
-Your Majesty!

367
00:28:10,320 --> 00:28:15,110
[Emperor Dezong fell gravely ill and took to his bed.]
-Summon the imperial physicians!

368
00:28:15,110 --> 00:28:18,030
By the Mandate of Heaven,
the Emperor decrees:

369
00:28:18,350 --> 00:28:19,720
Effective today,

370
00:28:19,750 --> 00:28:22,350
Zhou Zhu is to take command
of the Vanguard Camp

371
00:28:22,350 --> 00:28:24,400
and station his troops
outside Tianhuang City.

372
00:28:24,400 --> 00:28:26,400
No entry without imperial summons.

373
00:28:26,480 --> 00:28:27,880
No unauthorized departure.

374
00:28:27,880 --> 00:28:28,790
Violators

375
00:28:28,960 --> 00:28:31,090
shall be punished under military law.

376
00:28:34,200 --> 00:28:35,270
Yes, Your Majesty.

377
00:28:48,110 --> 00:28:48,920
General,

378
00:28:49,200 --> 00:28:51,130
what does His Majesty mean by this?

379
00:28:51,310 --> 00:28:52,110
General,

380
00:28:52,350 --> 00:28:55,010
His Highness Prince Xian
requests an audience.

381
00:29:34,480 --> 00:29:35,350
Father has ordered me

382
00:29:35,350 --> 00:29:37,310
to take command of the Vanguard Camp

383
00:29:37,310 --> 00:29:39,110
and barred me from entering the city.

384
00:29:39,110 --> 00:29:40,000
I suspect...

385
00:29:40,720 --> 00:29:42,720
he's worried that if he passes away,

386
00:29:43,350 --> 00:29:46,350
you won't be able to keep the situation
under control.

387
00:29:46,610 --> 00:29:47,610
Third Brother.

388
00:29:49,310 --> 00:29:51,720
There's something
I've always wanted to ask you.

389
00:29:51,720 --> 00:29:52,880
Have you ever felt

390
00:29:54,220 --> 00:29:56,220
that you've been treated unfairly?

391
00:29:59,270 --> 00:30:01,200
You wandered outside for 17 years.

392
00:30:02,400 --> 00:30:03,880
Father made amends

393
00:30:03,880 --> 00:30:05,880
by making you a Seven-Pearl Prince.

394
00:30:06,400 --> 00:30:07,860
I can only be happy for you.

395
00:30:08,110 --> 00:30:09,970
Why would I feel that it's unfair?

396
00:30:10,070 --> 00:30:12,270
Even without the title
of Seven-Pearl Prince,

397
00:30:12,270 --> 00:30:13,070
Father

398
00:30:13,720 --> 00:30:14,480
has already given me

399
00:30:14,480 --> 00:30:16,200
more than enough with the favor

400
00:30:16,200 --> 00:30:17,920
he showed me as a child.

401
00:30:18,200 --> 00:30:19,660
If anything, you have been

402
00:30:20,350 --> 00:30:21,950
the one he treated unfairly.

403
00:30:22,110 --> 00:30:22,920
Prince Xian, mind your words.

404
00:30:22,920 --> 00:30:23,780
Third Brother,

405
00:30:30,000 --> 00:30:31,240
I must say it.

406
00:30:32,550 --> 00:30:34,550
You've guarded the border for years

407
00:30:34,550 --> 00:30:36,160
and won countless victories.

408
00:30:36,160 --> 00:30:37,400
Yet even now,

409
00:30:38,980 --> 00:30:41,180
you're still only a commandery prince.

410
00:30:42,510 --> 00:30:43,890
You and I have always shared

411
00:30:43,890 --> 00:30:45,690
a special bond since childhood.

412
00:30:46,350 --> 00:30:47,110
Back then,

413
00:30:48,200 --> 00:30:49,860
when news of my death came out,

414
00:30:50,440 --> 00:30:51,740
you were the only one

415
00:30:52,160 --> 00:30:53,620
among the court officials

416
00:30:53,750 --> 00:30:55,550
who sought to uncover the truth.

417
00:30:55,680 --> 00:30:56,480
You even

418
00:30:59,140 --> 00:31:00,870
defied Father for my sake.

419
00:31:02,480 --> 00:31:03,340
Third Brother,

420
00:31:05,070 --> 00:31:07,200
I've never forgotten all the kindness

421
00:31:07,350 --> 00:31:08,440
you've shown me.

422
00:31:12,830 --> 00:31:14,760
Eldest Brother and Second Brother

423
00:31:16,000 --> 00:31:17,070
envied me

424
00:31:17,330 --> 00:31:18,460
and set traps for me.

425
00:31:18,790 --> 00:31:20,450
I don't care about any of that.

426
00:31:21,400 --> 00:31:23,000
But I cannot ignore

427
00:31:23,790 --> 00:31:25,240
how you feel.

428
00:31:25,240 --> 00:31:26,000
Enough.

429
00:31:32,110 --> 00:31:32,920
Oh, right.

430
00:31:34,570 --> 00:31:36,240
Before you met Father,

431
00:31:36,310 --> 00:31:37,110
did Aunt

432
00:31:38,550 --> 00:31:39,440
already know

433
00:31:39,440 --> 00:31:40,300
your identity?

434
00:31:42,110 --> 00:31:43,710
Who else knew it besides her?

435
00:31:44,920 --> 00:31:47,520
Your friend
from the Divine Constable Bureau,

436
00:31:48,880 --> 00:31:49,680
Meng Rui?

437
00:31:52,750 --> 00:31:53,550
Meng Rui...

438
00:31:55,100 --> 00:31:57,030
Perhaps he had guessed it long ago.

439
00:31:59,750 --> 00:32:01,960
If we are talking about feeling wronged,

440
00:32:01,960 --> 00:32:03,690
of course I have my grievances.

441
00:32:04,110 --> 00:32:05,770
Everyone knew your identity.

442
00:32:06,110 --> 00:32:07,270
I, your third brother, was the only one

443
00:32:07,270 --> 00:32:09,110
who was too stupid to figure it out

444
00:32:09,110 --> 00:32:10,400
until the very end.

445
00:32:10,920 --> 00:32:12,450
And in terms of unfairness,

446
00:32:12,750 --> 00:32:14,150
Father truly was unfair.

447
00:32:14,680 --> 00:32:15,750
He gave you

448
00:32:15,750 --> 00:32:17,350
such a brilliant mind,

449
00:32:18,000 --> 00:32:19,110
but made me a brute

450
00:32:19,110 --> 00:32:19,640
who knows nothing

451
00:32:19,640 --> 00:32:21,440
but leading troops into battle.

452
00:32:24,110 --> 00:32:24,920
By the way,

453
00:32:25,270 --> 00:32:26,000
you've spent years playing nice

454
00:32:26,000 --> 00:32:27,260
with the Liluo people.

455
00:32:28,400 --> 00:32:30,060
Given how vicious they are...

456
00:32:30,750 --> 00:32:32,110
how's your health?

457
00:32:38,550 --> 00:32:40,610
Third Brother, who do you take me for?

458
00:32:40,750 --> 00:32:42,270
I'm in perfect health.

459
00:32:42,790 --> 00:32:44,120
If you don't believe me,

460
00:32:44,590 --> 00:32:46,200
why don't we have a little spar,

461
00:32:46,200 --> 00:32:47,110
just like we did

462
00:32:47,160 --> 00:32:47,960
as children?

463
00:32:48,400 --> 00:32:50,480
Young Master Qingyang
is famous throughout jianghu.

464
00:32:50,480 --> 00:32:51,610
I'm no match for him.

465
00:32:52,190 --> 00:32:53,360
I won't fight back.

466
00:32:53,380 --> 00:32:54,470
Consider it

467
00:32:55,600 --> 00:32:56,980
my apology for keeping the truth from you

468
00:32:56,980 --> 00:32:58,110
all these years.

469
00:33:00,440 --> 00:33:03,210
♪ I open the door to winds of change ♪

470
00:33:03,480 --> 00:33:04,920
I still won't do it.

471
00:33:04,570 --> 00:33:07,280
♪ With no desire to gaze at the stars ♪

472
00:33:05,310 --> 00:33:06,840
You're the future emperor.

473
00:33:06,920 --> 00:33:07,850
I wouldn't dare.

474
00:33:08,270 --> 00:33:10,990
♪ Dreams may soothe the pain ♪

475
00:33:09,640 --> 00:33:10,440
Come on.

476
00:33:12,310 --> 00:33:15,240
♪ But they're too easily disturbed ♪

477
00:33:15,750 --> 00:33:17,880
♪ So I'll stand up high on a tower ♪

478
00:33:18,380 --> 00:33:20,220
♪ Never looking away ♪

479
00:33:20,560 --> 00:33:22,180
♪ And see how so-called fate ♪

480
00:33:22,620 --> 00:33:24,300
♪ Makes choices for me ♪

481
00:33:24,650 --> 00:33:26,390
♪ Let the breathtaking ♪

482
00:33:26,780 --> 00:33:28,320
♪ Take the place of cold, lonely stars ♪

483
00:33:28,620 --> 00:33:30,280
♪ Cutting through the mist ♪

484
00:33:30,610 --> 00:33:32,850
♪ To light up my eyes ♪

485
00:33:32,980 --> 00:33:35,640
♪ If the moonlight is hidden
and the candles burn out ♪

486
00:33:36,130 --> 00:33:38,180
♪ And I can't see myself ♪

487
00:33:41,010 --> 00:33:43,710
♪ I believe
some unseen longing surges within ♪

488
00:33:43,440 --> 00:33:44,240
Now,

489
00:33:44,240 --> 00:33:46,260
♪ Pulling me along ♪

490
00:33:45,550 --> 00:33:48,110
the fate of the nation
rests on your shoulders,

491
00:33:48,110 --> 00:33:49,710
so you must take good care of yourself.

492
00:33:49,710 --> 00:33:52,080
♪ When the moonlight returns,
the candle flames burn anew ♪

493
00:33:50,510 --> 00:33:52,630
Since I cannot leave the military camp,

494
00:33:52,630 --> 00:33:54,630
♪ And I can see myself ♪

495
00:33:52,790 --> 00:33:54,250
you should spend more time

496
00:33:54,920 --> 00:33:56,320
with Father in the palace

497
00:33:57,490 --> 00:34:00,090
♪ It won't betray
the fervent longing fate ♪

498
00:33:58,270 --> 00:34:00,630
and fulfill the filial duties
on my behalf.

499
00:34:00,630 --> 00:34:02,160
♪ Once stirred within me ♪

500
00:34:05,340 --> 00:34:08,130
♪ After all the twists and turns,
through a thousand joys and sorrows ♪

501
00:34:08,300 --> 00:34:12,199
♪ I only hope tomorrow finds me
still full of courage ♪

502
00:34:13,100 --> 00:34:15,030
♪ At daybreak, I'll look back ♪

503
00:34:15,690 --> 00:34:20,290
♪ And finally understand
why this journey had to be mine ♪

504
00:34:36,760 --> 00:34:37,550
Are you done?

505
00:34:38,110 --> 00:34:39,000
How is it?

506
00:34:53,510 --> 00:34:55,110
Just as I suspected,

507
00:34:55,360 --> 00:34:56,560
he died of poisoning.

508
00:34:57,670 --> 00:34:59,360
Based on our earlier deductions,

509
00:34:59,360 --> 00:35:00,550
the Grand Heir Apparent was already dead

510
00:35:00,550 --> 00:35:01,710
before he set out.

511
00:35:02,000 --> 00:35:04,000
The Frost Moth was then implanted
in his body to preserve it,

512
00:35:04,000 --> 00:35:05,400
giving Huo Daozhang time

513
00:35:05,400 --> 00:35:06,960
to alter the corpse.

514
00:35:06,960 --> 00:35:08,360
Judging by the timeline,

515
00:35:08,360 --> 00:35:09,070
the Grand Heir Apparent
was likely murdered

516
00:35:09,070 --> 00:35:10,550
as soon as he announced
he would personally attend

517
00:35:10,550 --> 00:35:11,960
the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

518
00:35:11,960 --> 00:35:12,920
The poison was administered

519
00:35:12,920 --> 00:35:14,210
right at the Crown Prince's residence.

520
00:35:14,210 --> 00:35:15,210
Whoever did it

521
00:35:15,330 --> 00:35:17,190
had precise control over the dosage

522
00:35:17,190 --> 00:35:18,590
and timing.

523
00:35:18,670 --> 00:35:19,590
Even the slightest difference,

524
00:35:19,590 --> 00:35:20,510
whether more or less poison,
or a little earlier or later,

525
00:35:20,510 --> 00:35:22,040
would have ruined the plan.

526
00:35:24,110 --> 00:35:24,920
Qingyang?

527
00:35:26,070 --> 00:35:26,880
No.

528
00:35:27,190 --> 00:35:29,510
Greetings, Your Highness Prince Xian.

529
00:35:31,280 --> 00:35:32,470
Please rise, Yan.

530
00:35:34,670 --> 00:35:35,480
Li Si!

531
00:35:38,190 --> 00:35:39,030
Li Si.

532
00:35:39,230 --> 00:35:40,030
Jiuying.

533
00:35:42,110 --> 00:35:43,640
How could you call him Li Si?

534
00:35:43,920 --> 00:35:44,920
He is Prince Xian.

535
00:35:44,960 --> 00:35:45,760
Everyone,

536
00:35:46,710 --> 00:35:49,110
there is no Prince Xian here,

537
00:35:49,510 --> 00:35:50,670
only Li Qingyang.

538
00:35:51,000 --> 00:35:53,710
I am here to discuss the case with you.

539
00:35:55,480 --> 00:35:57,140
What are the autopsy results?

540
00:35:57,280 --> 00:35:59,540
A dignified Seven-Pearl Prince like you

541
00:35:59,630 --> 00:36:01,160
still investigates cases?

542
00:36:02,360 --> 00:36:04,320
Once in the Divine Constable Bureau,

543
00:36:04,320 --> 00:36:06,520
always in the Divine Constable Bureau.

544
00:36:07,550 --> 00:36:08,960
Who would benefit the most

545
00:36:08,960 --> 00:36:11,110
from the Grand Heir Apparent's death?

546
00:36:11,550 --> 00:36:13,360
On the surface, it must be Zhou Miao,

547
00:36:13,360 --> 00:36:14,820
but I don't think it's him.

548
00:36:15,760 --> 00:36:16,550
Exactly.

549
00:36:17,070 --> 00:36:18,730
If Zhou Miao had poisoned him,

550
00:36:18,730 --> 00:36:19,920
there would be no need for him

551
00:36:19,920 --> 00:36:21,650
to carry out an assassination.

552
00:36:22,280 --> 00:36:24,080
Nor could it be the Crown Prince.

553
00:36:24,170 --> 00:36:25,230
His son is

554
00:36:25,230 --> 00:36:26,810
his biggest bargaining chip.

555
00:36:26,810 --> 00:36:29,450
[Retreat of Bamboo and Pine]

556
00:36:27,000 --> 00:36:28,440
Even to seize the throne,

557
00:36:28,760 --> 00:36:29,920
he wouldn't go so far as

558
00:36:29,920 --> 00:36:31,280
to poison

559
00:36:31,360 --> 00:36:32,400
his only legitimate son

560
00:36:32,400 --> 00:36:34,000
just to bring down Zhou Miao.

561
00:36:34,360 --> 00:36:36,000
He merely went with the flow,

562
00:36:36,190 --> 00:36:37,000
cold-bloodedly using

563
00:36:37,000 --> 00:36:38,230
his son's death

564
00:36:38,360 --> 00:36:40,710
to lure Zhou Miao
into taking a desperate risk,

565
00:36:40,710 --> 00:36:42,510
ultimately leading to his doom.

566
00:36:42,710 --> 00:36:43,630
So,

567
00:36:44,360 --> 00:36:45,760
the biggest beneficiary

568
00:36:46,170 --> 00:36:47,400
is still Liluo.

569
00:36:48,960 --> 00:36:51,160
It was the Dark Night that poisoned him.

570
00:36:51,920 --> 00:36:52,710
Now,

571
00:36:53,320 --> 00:36:54,590
Zhou Miao is dead,

572
00:36:54,880 --> 00:36:56,740
the Crown Prince has no heir left,

573
00:36:56,800 --> 00:36:58,360
and Great Shi is in turmoil.

574
00:36:59,280 --> 00:37:01,280
The only ones who want to see all this

575
